<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina placed $136 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentina placed $136 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank announced Wednesday it placed $136 million in overnight repurchase agreements at nine percent.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money fell to 7.15 percent from 7.30 percent at the close Tuesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar fell to 0.99980 pesos from 0.99982 pesos Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668</p>
</text>
